CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ member function-pointer pack expanded to full arity: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG must FAIL: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^.*found no match.*$
--
N5008 [temp.variadic]/5: pack expansion of a class template parameter pack in
the type of a data member (the parameter list of a member function-pointer type
R(*)(A...)) must expand to one parameter per element when Func<R(A...)> is
instantiated.  Fixed in template_mapt::apply (expand_parameter_packs on a
function-pointer pointee before substituting its parameters).  This is the
libstdc++ function<_Res(_ArgTypes...)>::_M_invoker shape.  Non-vacuous
(assertion 2 must FAIL).
